From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kiritake Kumi <root@niconiconi.us>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 10:40:35 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] riscv: dts: sophgo: enable ethernet and the device mode
 USB on LicheeRV Nano B

Enable the SG2002 internal ethernet PHY, like the Duo S does, and give the Type-C
port the device role so that the board can be reached over a USB network
gadget.

diff --git a/arch/riscv/boot/dts/sophgo/sg2002-licheerv-nano-b.dts b/arch/riscv/boot/dts/sophgo/sg2002-licheerv-nano-b.dts
index b1853770d..5f7c2160a 100644
--- a/arch/riscv/boot/dts/sophgo/sg2002-licheerv-nano-b.dts
+++ b/arch/riscv/boot/dts/sophgo/sg2002-licheerv-nano-b.dts
@@ -94,7 +94,15 @@ &uart0 {
 	status = "okay";
 };
 
+&gmac0 {
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
+&mdio {
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
 &usb {
-	dr_mode = "host";
+	dr_mode = "peripheral";
 	status = "okay";
 };
-- 
